cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Graphtage
message: >-
  Graphtage is a command-line utility and underlying library
  for semantically comparing and merging tree-like
  structures, such as JSON, JSON5, XML, HTML, YAML, TOML, INI,
  CSV, plist, and Python pickle files.
type: software
authors:
